        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SUPERBLY PRESENTED THREE BEDROOM SEMI-DETACHED PROPERTY JUST A TEN MINUTE WALK TO LONGFORD TOWN CENTRE.\r\n\r\nDavis Auctioneers present this new to the market, three-bedroom semi-detached property, situated just off the Ballinlaee Road. No. 25 Oakvale is just a few minutes walk to the town centre, while The Cathedral is a 500m stroll away. This fine three-bedroom home is ideally located, opposite the renowned St. Mel’s College. A ten-minute walk will take you to Longford train station, while the property is just 1.5km off the N4. \r\n\r\nWith a total floor area of c.1,000 sq. ft. the accommodation comprises of a sitting-room, kitchen/dining-room with patio doors leading to the rear garden. There are three bedrooms and a family bathroom on the first floor. The property is neatly presented and has been well maintained over the years and we highly recommended a viewing.\r\n\r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford, or phone us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEircode: N39 X9D2"
      },
